      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ProjectApprovalFlow\n\nCalled by pidgeon-head POST /api/projects/:id/approve (header auth, same PidgeonHead credential + NUXT_API_SECRET as the session ApprovalFlow). Body: { run_id, project_id }.\n\nLoads the approved run and its L3 insights, formats a Slack share-out draft (key-takeaway placeholder for the human, insights with corroboration grades), and DMs the requester. staging? branch sends to Rob instead.\n\nSee darwin/plans/close-project.md section E.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
